# Trillion

Trillion is the engine system powering the P‑ICO organism.  
It integrates 7 engines:

- Mag
- Port
- Web
- Index
- Pulse
- S‑wave
- N Star

The system connects directly to ARMAC timelapse data and exposes a local API + browser interface for running engines, generating signals, and visualizing outputs.

## Structure

- /engines — individual engine logic
- /core — interference, dominance, and signal aggregation
- /armac — ARMAC data fetch + parser
- /api — backend (Flask)
- /web — frontend (HTML + JS)
